2. MUIS prayer timetable

   Validation/official-timetables/data/muis-singapore-2026.csv holds MUIS's
   official prayer timetable for 2026, used only to validate the muis preset.

   Contains information from Muslim Prayer Timetable 2026 accessed on
   13 October 2026 from data.gov.sg, which is made available under the terms of
   the Singapore Open Data Licence version 1.0
   (https://data.gov.sg/open-data-licence).

3. Howard Hinnant's date algorithms

   GregorianDay converts between calendar dates and day counts with Howard
   Hinnant's days_from_civil and civil_from_days algorithms, described at
   https://howardhinnant.github.io/date_algorithms.html. Howard Hinnant placed
   them in the public domain. SalahTimes' implementation follows their
   description.
